{"strongs": "H2132", "word": "זַ֫יִת", "translit": "za.yit", "root": "זית", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "olive-tree, olive", "definition": "זַ֫יִת noun masculine Ps 52:10 olive-tree, olive (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic , זֵיתָא ; Ethiopic Arabic olive-tree, olive , olive-oil ; see Lag M iii. 215 ff Hom Aufsätze u. Abh., 1892, 94, 99 ff. ; √dubious; Thes and most derive from assumed זהה be bright, fresh, luxuriant (see below זִוּ ) + ת afformative which is. then treated as radical, compare Sta § 187 a ; but this not certain, compare Ol § 119 b, 142 a ; according to Lag Armen. Stud. § 1347 {abbrev } ז is Armen. loan-word, see also Lag M 1.c.; BN 219, Anm. ); — absolute ׳ ז Gen 8:11 , construct זֵית Deut 8:8 ; 2Kgs 18:32 suffix זֵיתְךָ Deut 24:20 , זֵיתֶ֑ךָ Exod 23:11 ; Deut 28:40 plural זֵיתִים Deut 6:11 , etc.; — 1. olive-tree Judg 9:8 ; Judg 9:9 (personified, in Jotham's fable), Hos 14:7 (simile of beauty), Job 15:33 = (as casting off its flowers, simile of wicked man); in 2Sam 15:23 insert אֲשֶׁר ׳ הַזּ (before הַמִּדְבָּר , read ׳ בַּמּ ) ᵐ5 L Dr ; also plural of two olive-trees Zech 4:3 ; Zech 4:11 רַעֲנָן ׳ ז Ps 52:10 fresh , (thriving) olive-tree (simile of prosperity), so Jer 11:16 ׳ עֲלֶהזֿ Gen 8:11 ( J ) olive-branch, sprig , compare Neh 8:15 (here + עֲלֵי עֵץשֶֿׁמֶן , etc.); also plural שְׁתִלֵי זֵיתִים Ps 128:3 olive-shoots (simile of children); שִׁבֲּלֵי זֵיתִים Zech 4:12 olive-branches (in Zechariah's vision); זַיִת in representative or collective sense, = olive-trees , groups of growing olive-trees, as property, source of wealth, olive-yards Exod 23:11 ( J E ; + כֶּרֶם ), Judg 15:5 (+ id. ); עֵץהַֿזַּיִת Hag 2:19 (+ הַגֶּפֶן וְהַתְּאֵנָה וְהָרִמּוֺן ); also in phrase כִּחֵשׁ מַעֲשֵׂהזַֿיִת Hab 3:17 the bearing, yield , of olive-trees (|| וּשְׁדֵמוֺר לֹאעָֿשָׂה אֹכֶל , compare also תְּאֵנָה and יְבוּל גֶּפֶן v a ); specifically זֵית שֶׁמֶן , oil-yielding olive-trees Deut 8:8 compare 2Kgs 18:32 ׳ נֹקֶף ז striking or beating of olive-trees Isa 17:6 ; Isa 24:13 (simile of desolation at judgment of ׳ י ), compare תַחְבֹּט ׳ כִּ זֵיתְךָ Deut 24:20 rather more often plural; Amos 4:9 (|| גַּנּוֺת , כְּרָמִים , תְּאֵנִים ), 1Sam 8:14 (|| שָׂדוֺת , כְּרָמִים ), compare also Deut 6:11 ; Deut 28:40 a Josh 24:13 ; 2Kgs 5:26 ; 1Chr 27:28 ; Neh 5:11 ; Neh 9:25 . 2. of fruit of olive-tree, olives: Deut 28:40 b (with שֶׁמֶן ); תִּדְרֹךְ זַיִת Mic 6:15 (|| שֶׁמֶן ); also שֶׁמֶן זַיִת olive-oil Exod 27:20 ; Exod 30:24 ( P ) Lev 24:2 ( H ). 3. in designations of place: מַעֲלֵה הַזֵּיתִים 2Sam 15:30 the ascent of the olive-trees ( ᵐ5 ἐν τῇ ἀναβάσει τῶν ἐλαιῶν = Mount of Olives); הַרהַֿזֵּיתִים Zech 14:4 (twice in verse) ( ᵐ5 τὸ ὄρος τῶν ἐλαιῶν ); the well-known hill east of Jerusalem (NT usually as Zech 14:4 ᵐ5 , e.g. Mark 13:3 compare also הָהָר 1Kgs 11:7 ; Neh 8:15 ᵑ7 טזּר זֵיתַיָּא 2Kgs 23:13 compare 2Sam 15:30 ; Zech 14:4 etc.; ᵑ7 Song 8:5 טוּר מִשְׁחָא , and so Talmud etc.)", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2346')\">BDB2346</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2132')\">H2132</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2345')\">BDB2345</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2347')\">BDB2347</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זַ֫יִת</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ps 52:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,10)\">Ps 52:10</ref></sup> <highlightword>olive-tree, olive</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Aramaic <placeholder1469/>, <bdbheb>זֵיתָא</bdbheb>; Ethiopic <placeholder1470/> Arabic <placeholder1471/> <highlight>olive-tree, olive</highlight>, <placeholder1472/> <highlight>olive-oil</highlight>; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>M iii. 215 ff</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hom')\">Hom<sup>Aufsätze u. Abh., 1892, 94, 99 ff.</sup></lookup>; √dubious; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> and most derive from assumed <bdbheb>זהה</bdbheb> <highlight>be bright, fresh, luxuriant</highlight> (see below <bdbheb>זִוּ</bdbheb>) + <bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> afformative which is. then treated as radical, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>§ 187 a</sup></lookup>; but this not certain, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol<sup>§ 119 b, 142 a</sup></lookup>; according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>Armen. Stud. § 1347 {abbrev</sup></lookup>}<bdbheb>ז</bdbheb> is Armen. loan-word, see also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>M 1.c.; BN 219, Anm.</sup></lookup>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 8:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,8,11)\">Gen 8:11</ref>, construct <bdbheb>זֵית</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 8:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,8)\">Deut 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:32\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,32)\">2Kgs 18:32</ref> suffix <bdbheb>זֵיתְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 24:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,20)\">Deut 24:20</ref>, <bdbheb>זֵיתֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,11)\">Exod 23:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:40\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,40)\">Deut 28:40</ref> plural <bdbheb>זֵיתִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 6:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,11)\">Deut 6:11</ref>, etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>olive-tree</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,8)\">Judg 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 9:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,9)\">Judg 9:9</ref> (personified, in Jotham's fable), <ref ref=\"Hos 14:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,14,7)\">Hos 14:7</ref> (simile of beauty), <ref ref=\"Job 15:33\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,33)\">Job 15:33</ref> = (as casting off its flowers, simile of wicked man); in <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,23)\">2Sam 15:23</ref> insert <bdbheb>אֲשֶׁר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַזּ</bdbheb> (before <bdbheb>הַמִּדְבָּר</bdbheb>, read <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּמּ</bdbheb>) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>; also plural of two <highlight>olive-trees</highlight> <ref ref=\"Zech 4:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(38,4,3)\">Zech 4:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 4:11\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(38,4,11)\">Zech 4:11</ref> <bdbheb>רַעֲנָן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 52:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,52,10)\">Ps 52:10</ref> <highlight>fresh</highlight>, (thriving) <highlight>olive-tree</highlight> (simile of prosperity), so <ref ref=\"Jer 11:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,16)\">Jer 11:16</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֲלֶהזֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 8:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,8,11)\">Gen 8:11</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>olive-branch, sprig</highlight>, compare <ref ref=\"Neh 8:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,15)\">Neh 8:15</ref> (here + <bdbheb>עֲלֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עֵץשֶֿׁמֶן</bdbheb>, etc.); also plural <bdbheb>שְׁתִלֵי זֵיתִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 128:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"128\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"128\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,128,3)\">Ps 128:3</ref> <highlight>olive-shoots</highlight> (simile of children); <bdbheb>שִׁבֲּלֵי זֵיתִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 4:12\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(38,4,12)\">Zech 4:12</ref> <highlight>olive-branches</highlight> (in Zechariah's vision); <bdbheb>זַיִת</bdbheb> in representative or collective sense, = <highlight>olive-trees</highlight>, groups of growing olive-trees, as property, source of wealth, <highlight>olive-yards</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,11)\">Exod 23:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; + <bdbheb>כֶּרֶם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Judg 15:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,15,5)\">Judg 15:5</ref> (+ <highlight>id.</highlight>); <bdbheb>עֵץהַֿזַּיִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hag 2:19\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,19)\">Hag 2:19</ref> (+ <bdbheb>הַגֶּפֶן וְהַתְּאֵנָה וְהָרִמּוֺן</bdbheb>); also in phrase <bdbheb>כִּחֵשׁ מַעֲשֵׂהזַֿיִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 3:17\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,17)\">Hab 3:17</ref> <highlight>the bearing, yield</highlight>, of <highlight>olive-trees</highlight> (|| <bdbheb>וּשְׁדֵמוֺר לֹאעָֿשָׂה אֹכֶל</bdbheb>, compare also <bdbheb>תְּאֵנָה</bdbheb> and <bdbheb>יְבוּל גֶּפֶן</bdbheb> v<sup>a</sup>); specifically <bdbheb>זֵית שֶׁמֶן</bdbheb>, <highlight>oil-yielding olive-trees</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 8:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,8)\">Deut 8:8</ref> compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:32\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,32)\">2Kgs 18:32</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֹקֶף ז</bdbheb> <highlight>striking</highlight> or <highlight>beating of olive-trees</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 17:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,17,6)\">Isa 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 24:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,24,13)\">Isa 24:13</ref> (simile of desolation at judgment of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>), compare <bdbheb>תַחְבֹּט</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כִּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>זֵיתְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 24:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,20)\">Deut 24:20</ref> rather more often plural; <ref ref=\"Amos 4:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,9)\">Amos 4:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>גַּנּוֺת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כְּרָמִים</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>תְּאֵנִים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 8:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,8,14)\">1Sam 8:14</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שָׂדוֺת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כְּרָמִים</bdbheb>), compare also <ref ref=\"Deut 6:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,11)\">Deut 6:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:40\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,40)\">Deut 28:40</ref>a <ref ref=\"Josh 24:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,13)\">Josh 24:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:26\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,26)\">2Kgs 5:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:28\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,28)\">1Chr 27:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 5:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,11)\">Neh 5:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 9:25\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,25)\">Neh 9:25</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of fruit of olive-tree, <highlight>olives:</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 28:40\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,40)\">Deut 28:40</ref>b (with <bdbheb>שֶׁמֶן</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>תִּדְרֹךְ זַיִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 6:15\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,15)\">Mic 6:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שֶׁמֶן</bdbheb>); also <bdbheb>שֶׁמֶן זַיִת</bdbheb> <highlight>olive-oil</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,20)\">Exod 27:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,24)\">Exod 30:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Lev 24:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,2)\">Lev 24:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> in designations of place: <bdbheb>מַעֲלֵה הַזֵּיתִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:30\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,30)\">2Sam 15:30</ref> <highlight>the ascent of the olive-trees</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>ἐν τῇ ἀναβάσει</grk> <grk>τῶν ἐλαιῶν</grk> = Mount of Olives); <bdbheb>הַרהַֿזֵּיתִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 14:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,4)\">Zech 14:4</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup><grk>τὸ ὄρος τῶν ἐλαιῶν</grk>); the well-known hill east of Jerusalem (NT usually as <ref ref=\"Zech 14:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,4)\">Zech 14:4</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, e.g. <ref ref=\"Mark 13:3\" b=\"41\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(41,13,3)\">Mark 13:3</ref> compare also <bdbheb>הָהָר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,7)\">1Kgs 11:7</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/> <ref ref=\"Neh 8:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,15)\">Neh 8:15</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>טזּר זֵיתַיָּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,13)\">2Kgs 23:13</ref> compare <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:30\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,30)\">2Sam 15:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 14:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,4)\">Zech 14:4</ref> etc.; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <ref ref=\"Song 8:5\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,5)\">Song 8:5</ref> <bdbheb>טוּר מִשְׁחָא</bdbheb>, and so Talmud etc.) </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 52:10", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 52, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Gen 8:11", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 8, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Deut 8:8", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 8, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Kgs 18:32", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 18, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Deut 24:20", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 24, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Exod 23:11", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 23, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Deut 28:40", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 28, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "Deut 6:11", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 6, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Judg 9:8", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Judg 9:9", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Hos 14:7", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 14, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Job 15:33", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 15, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "2Sam 15:23", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Zech 4:3", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 4, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Zech 4:11", "boo